---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Shipping & Delivery Policy — AASRA" description="Shipping rates and delivery terms.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:720px;">
      <h1>Shipping &amp; Delivery Policy</h1>
      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> November 16, 2026</p>

      <h3>Courier and coverage</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Courier:</strong> TCS across Pakistan.</li>
        <li>We ship to all major cities in Pakistan. City-based flat rates are shown at checkout.</li>
        <li>Free shipping on orders above <strong>20,000 PKR</strong>.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Dispatch and delivery times</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Dispatch:</strong> within 2 business days of payment confirmation (full payment or balance paid).</li>
        <li><strong>Delivery estimate:</strong> 2–7 days depending on city.</li>
        <li>Deposit orders ship only after the balance is paid in full.</li>
        <li>Tracking is provided once shipped — use Order Lookup to check status.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Shipping rates</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Flat rate by city (e.g. Karachi, Lahore: 250 PKR; other cities vary).</li>
        <li>Rates are calculated server-side at checkout and cannot be changed by the browser.</li>
        <li>Free shipping threshold: 20,000 PKR.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Payment and shipping</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Payment is online only — no Cash on Delivery.</li>
        <li>Full payment: order ships once payment is confirmed.</li>
        <li>Deposit payment: order ships only after the balance is paid in full.</li>
      </ul>

      <p><strong>Business contact:</strong> orders@aasra.shop · WhatsApp: +92 300 0000000 · Karachi, Pakistan</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
